# EXPRESS-010 manual requests.
# 1. Start the server: npm run dev:express:10
# 2. Click "Send Request" above a request (VS Code extension "REST Client").
# The server terminal prints every verify(...) call.

@host = http://localhost:3000

### Health, no token needed (expect 200 { "status": "ok" })
GET {{host}}/health

### Logged in as Alice (expect 200 { "id": "u-alice", "role": "member" })
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer token-alice

### Logged in as admin (expect 200 { "id": "u-root", "role": "admin" })
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer token-root

### No header (expect 401, verify is not called)
GET {{host}}/me

### Wrong format (expect 401, verify is not called)
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Basic abc

### Unknown token (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer expired

### Login service down (expect 503, no "login-service" in the body)
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer token-down
